FROM gemma4:12b
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
# 32K, not 16K: Android Studio's agent spends ~12.5K tokens on its own prompt
# and tools, so at 16K its replies (file edits) were cut off at the context
# limit. Costs ~300 MiB over 16K (sliding-window attention; measured
# 2026-10-17). The gateway reports this to clients as context_length.
# No temperature on purpose: gemma4's own defaults (temperature 1, top_k 64,
# top_p 0.95) apply. 0.2 (tuned for llama3.1:8b) made its thinking loop for
# minutes -- see editors/acp/config.toml.
